The MAX98357 I2S amplifier is better matched to an ESP32. Trying to force full I2S audio through a
Nano is possible in limited cases but is generally more friction than it is worth for this project’s teaching
goals. Keep the Nano path simple and reserve the ESP32 + MAX98357 for when higher-fidelity output
is needed.
Both paths can still publish events or status into the same ROS 2 pipeline so later nodes remain
independent of which playback method is used.
5. How This Fits the Overall Architecture
Lesson Set 05 is an output and interaction layer. It should consume the fused state and discrete events
already produced by Sets 01–04 rather than re-implementing sensing.
Typical flow:
• Sensor nodes publish motion, distance, orientation, shock, tilt, and (optionally) sound-energy
events.
• A lightweight state or behavior node decides which reaction is appropriate.
• The audio node (or the MCU driving the MP3 Trigger / MAX98357) plays the corresponding
sound.
Suggested topic direction (still flexible):
• /sound_event or /audio_energy (from the listening side)
• /play_sound or /character_response (command topic for playback)
• /audio_status (optional feedback that a sound finished or is playing)
